flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Navigate to Patient — Lab Results tab\nor Visit detail — Labs section]
    B --> C{Authorized?\nAdmin or Doktor}
    C -->|No| D[403 Forbidden]
    D --> Z([End])
    C -->|Yes| E[Click Log Lab Result]
    E --> F[Display form\nparameter, value, unit, category, optional visit link]
    F --> G[Fill in result details]
    G --> H[Optionally link to a Visit]
    H --> I[Submit]
    I --> J{Validation passes?}
    J -->|No| K[Show validation errors]
    K --> G
    J -->|Yes| L[LabResult::create persisted]
    L --> M[Appear in patient lab history\nand optionally in visit detail]
    M --> N([End])
